{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:1fb2db069c7542c1","name":"Thinsuit","source":{"id":"source:reference-1fb2db069c7542c1","title":"Thinsuit","revision":20070,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:08:54Z","sha256":"38c87c0abaa781a72965299a0ff9325df0636c6f5659ecd7202748e18e6d0022","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20070","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Thinsuit&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-1fb2db069c7542c1","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Insulating against extreme pressure and temperature, a Thinsuit is a skintight garment that covers the entire body except for the face, which is covered by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Breath Mask"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Breath_Mask","referenceId":"reference:c519d35f0c8eed50"}," that provides 1 hour of breathable air. The Thinsuit comes with an environmental system of miniscule heaters and coolers that allow the wearer to remain comfortable in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Extreme Heat or Cold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Extreme_Heat_or_Cold","referenceId":"reference:2e2dc62062258b67"},". It provides the wearer with a +5 bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," when resisting ",{"tag":"a","children":["Extreme Temperatures"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Extreme_Temperatures"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In addition, the suit further reduces damage taken in such circumstances. If an attack is successful, the character takes only half damage and does not move along the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},", while a failed attack deals no damage.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Armor","referenceId":"reference:1b329ddc8a34adfe"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 900\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Maximum ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," Bonus:"]}," +6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 1 Kilogram\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," The Thinsuit can be worn in tandem with other clothing or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
